{% comment %}
  Alterpop — Universes Panel. Source of truth: Wireframe_Alterpop_3_3.pdf 6b.
  "Trigger, not mega-menu: a single thin horizontal strip (~96px) under the
  nav, 6-8 franchises by name + small square thumbnail, no columns/categories.
  Opens/closes on --motion-editorial. A discovery moment, not a transaction."

  Plain <details> (id starts with "Details-" so global.js wires Escape-to-close
  + aria). The strip is absolutely positioned full-width under .header-wrapper.

  Source, in order of precedence:
  1. shop.metafields.alterpop.universes.value — the app-populated list
     ({ title, url, image } per item). Written by the sync app; takes
     over automatically once populated.
  2. header section setting `universe_collections` (collection_list) — an
     explicit merchant pick of real collections, entered in the theme
     editor. Not inference: the merchant is naming the collections
     directly, same as any other Dawn collection-list section setting.
  3. collections | where: 'template_suffix', 'universe-room' — every
     collection using the universe-room template, auto-discovered when
     neither of the above is set. NOTE: the global `collections` object
     is capped at 50 items by Liquid — revisit if the catalog grows
     past it.
  No placeholder branch (2026-09-16 review, correction 1): with neither
  source set, or every sourced universe at 0 products, the whole trigger
  renders nothing rather than inventing franchise names the store doesn't
  carry.
  Same three-way source as the mobile drawer (snippets/mobile-drawer.liquid).

  Accepts: universe_collections {Array<collection>} — from the header
  section's `universe_collections` setting, passed in by sections/header.liquid.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign ap_universes = shop.metafields.alterpop.universes.value
  assign ap_universes_from_collections = false

  if ap_universes == blank and universe_collections.size > 0
    assign ap_universes_from_collections = true
    assign ap_collections_list = universe_collections
  elsif ap_universes == blank
    assign ap_auto = collections | where: 'template_suffix', 'universe-room' | sort: 'title'
    if ap_auto.size > 0
      assign ap_universes_from_collections = true
      assign ap_collections_list = ap_auto
    endif
  endif

  assign ap_visible_count = 0
  if ap_universes_from_collections
    for collection in ap_collections_list
      unless collection.products_count == 0
        assign ap_visible_count = ap_visible_count | plus: 1
      endunless
    endfor
  elsif ap_universes != blank
    for universe in ap_universes
      unless universe.products_count == 0
        assign ap_visible_count = ap_visible_count | plus: 1
      endunless
    endfor
  endif
-%}

{%- if ap_visible_count > 0 -%}
<details class="ap-universes" id="Details-universes-strip">
  <summary class="ap-nav__link ap-universes__trigger" aria-haspopup="true">
    {{ 'sections.header.universes' | t }}
    <svg class="ap-nav__caret" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M5 7.5 10 12.5 15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
  </summary>

  <div class="ap-universes__strip">
    <div class="ap-universes__strip-inner page-width">
      <ul class="ap-universes__row" role="list">
        {%- if ap_universes_from_collections -%}
          {%- for collection in ap_collections_list -%}
            {%- if collection.products_count == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ collection.url }}">
                <span class="ap-universes__thumb">
                  {%- if collection.featured_image -%}
                    {{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 96 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: collection.title | escape }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    <span class="ap-universes__thumb--ph" aria-hidden="true">{{ collection.title | slice: 0, 1 }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                <span class="ap-universes__name">{{ collection.title | escape }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for universe in ap_universes -%}
            {%- if universe.products_count == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ universe.url }}">
                <span class="ap-universes__thumb">
                  {%- if universe.image -%}
                    {{ universe.image | image_url: width: 96 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: universe.title | escape }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    <span class="ap-universes__thumb--ph" aria-hidden="true">{{ universe.title | slice: 0, 1 }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                <span class="ap-universes__name">{{ universe.title | escape }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
{%- endif -%}
